          "whatsNew": "The split sheet is rebuilt on stock Material 3 components.\n\n* Split with others is one card.\n* People are chips. You is a filter chip, each added person is an input chip with an avatar and a remove icon, and the chips wrap onto new lines.\n* The search field is filled and pill shaped.\n* Equal, Amount, % and Items are a segmented button under a Divide by label.\n* Every mode shows one list of shares, with an avatar, the name and the amount at the end of the row.\n"
        }
